Work around compiled bound-method lifetime handling in the MacPorts
Nuitka/PySide6 build. Reuse a retained callable for connect and disconnect.
Destroy Qt before Nuitka clears the module state used by widget callbacks.

--- a/Ghost-Downloader-3.py
+++ b/Ghost-Downloader-3.py
@@ -304,3 +304,4 @@
     exitCode = app.exec()
     primaryInstance.close()
+    app.shutdown()
     sys.exit(exitCode)

